pecial vibration and purpose: to be the primary most supportive location to spread the original and ancient essence of yoga.<\/span><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Yoga does not end inside a yoga hall or studio, it leads to personal revelation, unique evolutions, and individual transformation. At Purnam Yogashala, we encourage you to uncover the multiple layers of yourself and yoga. Therefore, we promise you to guide you all along the way! We are very conscious of this responsibility and make sincere efforts to share yoga its its ancient and authentic nature. With compassion, understanding and sensitivity, we are ready to support you and watch you integrate peace and calmness into your life and being.<\/span><\/p>\n<p>[\/et_pb_text][dipi_button_grid flex_direction=&#8221;row&#8221; _builder_version=&#8221;4.27.0&#8243; _module_preset=&#8221;default&#8221; link_option_url=&#8221;https:\/\/purnamyogashala.com\/about-us&#8221; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221;][dipi_button_grid_child button_id=&#8221;Button Black&#8221; button_text=&#8221;Discover More&#8221; _builder_version=&#8221;4.16&#8243; _module_preset=&#8221;default&#8221; custom_button=&#8221;on&#8221; button_text_size=&#8221;14px&#8221; button_bg_color=&#8221;#000000&#8243; button_border_width=&#8221;1px&#8221; button_border_color=&#8221;#000000&#8243; button_font=&#8221;|300|||||||&#8221; button_custom_margin=&#8221;||||false|false&#8221; button_custom_padding=&#8221;12px|20px|12px|20px|false|false&#8221; custom_margin=&#8221;|||0px|false|false&#8221; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221; button_bg_color__hover_enabled=&#8221;on|desktop&#8221; button_bg_color__hover=&#8221;#F46150&#8243; button_bg_enable_color__hover=&#8221;on&#8221; button_border_color__hover_enabled=&#8221;on|desktop&#8221; button_border_color__hover=&#8221;#F46150&#8243; button_custom_padding__hover_enabled=&#8221;on|desktop&#8221; button_custom_padding__hover=&#8221;12px|20px|12px|20px|false|fal