;default&#8221; custom_margin=&#8221;-8px|||||&#8221; custom_padding=&#8221;||1px|||&#8221; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221;][et_pb_row column_structure=&#8221;1_2,1_2&#8243; _builder_version=&#8221;4.26.1&#8243; _module_preset=&#8221;default&#8221; custom_margin=&#8221;-30px|auto||auto||&#8221; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221;][et_pb_column type=&#8221;1_2&#8243; _builder_version=&#8221;4.26.1&#8243; _module_preset=&#8221;default&#8221; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221;][et_pb_text _builder_version=&#8221;4.26.1&#8243; _module_preset=&#8221;default&#8221; text_font=&#8221;Poppins|700|||||||&#8221; text_text_color=&#8221;#000000&#8243; text_font_size=&#8221;33px&#8221; text_letter_spacing=&#8221;1px&#8221; text_line_height=&#8221;1.5em&#8221; header_2_font=&#8221;Poppins|300||on|||||&#8221; header_2_text_color=&#8221;#000000&#8243; header_2_font_size=&#8221;45px&#8221; header_2_letter_spacing=&#8221;1px&#8221; header_2_line_height=&#8221;1.3em&#8221; custom_margin=&#8221;||15px||false|false&#8221; header_2_font_size_tablet=&#8221;45px&#8221; header_2_font_size_phone=&#8221;35px&#8221; header_2_font_size_last_edited=&#8221;on|phone&#8221; header_2_line_height_tablet=&#8221;1.3em&#8221; header_2_line_height_phone=&#8221;1.4em&#8221; header_2_line_height_last_edited=&#8221;on|phone&#8221; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221;]<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">Purnam Yogashala offers Yoga for all ages and lifestyle<\/p>\n<p>[\/et_pb_text][et_pb_image src=&#8221;https:\/\/purnamyogashala.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/07\/ABOUT-PURNAM.jpeg&#8221; title_text=&#8221;ABOUT PURNAM&#8221; _builder_version=&#8221;4.26.1&#8243; _module_preset=&#8221;default&#8221; locked=&#8221;off&#8221; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221;][\/et_pb_image][et_pb_image src=&#8221;https:\/\/purnamyogashala.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/07\/YOGA-ALLIANCE-RYT-1.png&#8221; title_text=&#8221;YOGA ALLIANCE RYT&#8221; _builder_version=&#8221;4.26.1&#8243; _module_preset=&#8221;default&#8221; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221;][\/et_pb_image][\/et_pb_column][et_pb_column type=&#8221;1_2&#8243; _builder_version=&#8221;4.26.1&#8243; _module_preset=&#8221;default&#8221; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221;][et_pb_text _builder_version=&#8221;4.27.0&#8243; _module_preset=&#8221;default&#8221; text_font=&#8221;Poppins|500|||||||&#8221; text_text_color=&#8221;#333333&#8243; text_font_size=&#8221;15px&#8221; text_letter_spacing=&#8221;1px&#8221; text_line_height=&#8221;1.8em&#8221; text_font_size_tablet=&#8221;&#8221; text_font_size_phone=&#8221;14px&#8221; text_font_size_last_edited=&#8221;on|phone&#8221; text_line_height_tablet=&#8221;2.3em&#8221; text_line_height_phone=&#8221;2.2em&#8221; text_line_height_last_edited=&#8221;on|phone&#8221; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221;]<\/p>\n<p>Purnam Yoga Shala &#8211; Offers a Holistic and multistyle Practice to Bring forward Ancient Wisdom for a Modern Age. Purnam Yoga Shal Approach emphasizes a balanced class All Classes are structured to systematically align the physical, energetic, mental\/emotional, and intuitive self through the five elements of practice and the five energetic principles. Yogi raj Manoj is renowned for his joyful and compassionate teachings, during challenging postures, students are encouraged to smile, thus making non-competition and contentment true.<\/p>\n<p>At Purnam yogashala, we run monthly 200 Hour Yoga Teacher Training Courses and Yoga retreats with focus on holistic Yoga and multi style yoga to bring forward ancient wisdom for a modern age.<\/p>\n<p>We are a modern Yoga Teacher Training School in Agonda, Goa, India that combines Western standards with ancient, traditional yoga practices and teaching methodology. Besides our monthly residential Yoga Teacher Training courses, we also offer comprehensive Online Yoga Teacher Training courses (Yoga Alliance USA, 200 Hours) that can be started at any time. As a qualified team of yoga instructors, we aim to provide the most professional, satisfying and grounding environment for yoga practise.<\/p>\n<p>Our mission is to guide yoga teacher training students from all over the world and prepare them to become confident and happy individuals and be able to share their knowledge with the world. Through years of teaching experience at our own Yoga Teacher Training, we have created a safe and holistic space for personal growth and healing.<\/p>\n<p>[\/et_pb_text][\/et_pb_column][\/et_pb_row][et_pb_row column_structure=&#8221;1_2,1_2&#8243; use_custom_gutter=&#8221;on&#8221; gutter_width=&#8221;2&#8243; _builder_version=&#8221;4.16&#8243; _module_preset=&#8221;default&#8221; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221;][et_pb_column type=&#8221;1_2&#8243; _builder_version=&#8221;4.16&#8243; _module_preset=&#8221;default&#8221; background_color=&#8221;#F46150&#8243; custom_padding=&#8221;35px||35px||true|false&#8221; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221;][dipi_counter suffix=&#8221;+&#8221; count_to_number=&#8221;16&#8243; _builder_version=&#8221;4.16&#8243; _module_preset=&#8221;default&#8221; number_font=&#8221;Poppins|300||on|||||&#8221; number_text_color=&#8221;#FFFFFF&#8221; suffix_font=&#8221;Poppins|300||on|||||&#8221; suffix_text_color=&#8221;#FFFFFF&#8221; custom_margin=&#8221;||||false|false&#8221; custom_css_main_element=&#8221;margin-bottom: 10px !important;&#8221; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221;][\/dipi_counter][et_pb_text _builder_version=&#8221;4.27.0&#8243; _module_preset=&#8221;default&#8221; text_font=&#8221;Poppins|600||on|||||&#8221; text_text_color=&#8221;#FFFFFF&#8221; text_font_size=&#8221;17px&#8221; text_letter_spacing=&#8221;2px&#8221; text_orientation=&#8221;center&#8221; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221;]<\/p>\n<p>Years Experience<\/p>\n<p>[\/et_pb_text][\/et_pb_column][et_pb_column type=&#8221;1_2&#8243; _builder_version=&#8221;4.16&#8243; _module_preset=&#8221;default&#8221; background_color=&#8221;#FAECDC&#8221; custom_padding=&#8221;35px||35px||true|false&#8221; global_colors_info